kfast and coffee spots. Also very close to both the New and Abu Tig marinas. Bonus: it’s super kid-friendly too!","rental_id":250287,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z"},{"id":5859686,"review":".","rental_id":250287,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z"},{"id":5922725,"review":"The unit was just as described with easy access to pool and beach and the host was very responsive","rental_id":250287,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z"},{"id":5959001,"review":"We will definitely deal with Xuru in future as they are a wonderful and professional host","rental_id":250287,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:13.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:13.000000Z"},{"id":5963053,"review":"Nice place","rental_id":250287,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:13.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:13.000000Z"},{"id":6029344,"review":"Second time there and won’t be the last definitely!Perfect apartment, super clean, near to the beach and gate. Although the pool was under maintenance, the view and pool accessibility are amazing. Responsive and friendly host as well.","rental_id":250287,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z"},{"id":6120035,"review":"Good place!","rental_id":250287,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z"},{"id":6131309,"review":"it was nice stay clean  everything there checkin smooth good price the owner very responsive but not fixable","rental_id":250287,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z"},{"id":6138669,"review":"The accommodation was really great and very good, i want to enhance the check-in to be at 12:00 pm not 3:00 pm, but overall it was 5 stars location, rooms and facilities","rental_id":250287,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z"},{"id":6162152,"review":"Location is amazing walkable to beach , supermarket and cafes,, it matched the pic exactly,, Xuru team was very responsive,, loved the place, wont be the last time definitely","rental_id":250287,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z"}],"amenities":[]}